VALUES ('412fb480-1554-55d5-aa36-5aed7061bb18', '0777a7de-46ff-5aa0-87bf-8a6341357c18', 'vehicle_type', 'Vehicle Type', 'The class of vehicle or equipment, such as truck, trailer or forklift. Chosen on creation; dispatch uses it to match loads and tasks to suitable vehicles. A rigid powered road vehicle that carries goods in its own body. A powered unit that pulls a trailer, carrying no load of its own. An unpowered load carrier towed by a tractor unit. A powered lifting vehicle used in yards and warehouses to move pallets. Lifting equipment used to raise and move heavy loads such as containers. Transport equipment that fits none of the listed classes. Read with capacity.', 1073, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 30, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
