VALUES ('c3097db2-5835-5d1f-a357-c07e2ca97776', 'a2035ea1-b5cc-5af8-90ce-b95902f17aad', 'status', 'Status', 'Released to the warehouse with stock reserved, but work has not yet started. Being picked from stock by warehouse staff. Picked and packed, and waiting for the carrier to collect it. Handed over to the carrier for delivery. Received by the customer. Stopped by a problem that someone must resolve before work continues. Withdrawn because the order is no longer needed; no further work is done. Which step the fulfillment has reached. Moved on by the warehouse and transport steps as they are done. Late fulfillments are found by comparing the status with the promised date.', 1028, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, 30, 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
