VALUES ('202510dc-2feb-5947-b38b-d8c1d029e17a', 'Fuel Transaction Status', 'Maintain Fuel Transaction Status records', 'Create, find and maintain Fuel Transaction Status records. The list shows every Fuel Transaction Status you have access to — select a row to open it, or use New to add one. Each row is a single Fuel Transaction Status, described by 6 fields.

